{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05253","headline":"兴庆池侍宴应制 · 武平一","name":"兴庆池侍宴应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"銮舆羽驾直城隈，帐殿旌门此地开。\n皎洁灵潭图日月，参差画舸结楼台。\n波摇岸影随桡转，风送荷香逐酒来。\n愿奉圣情欢不极，长游云汉几昭回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武平一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05253.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05253","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}